{"sha": "0e971951c8904a0717cb218031ed3eac6c2c549decaef544a6330826247c2f6a", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g12:newtons-laws} 章 --- 牛顿运动定律}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:newtons-laws:1}", "(a) $p = 70 \\times 10 = \\qty{7.0e2}{kg.m/s}$。", "(b) $v = \\qty{13.9}{m/s}$：$p \\approx \\qty{1.8e4}{kg.m/s}$。", "(c) $p = 0.0080 \\times 800 = \\qty{6.4}{kg.m/s}$。汽车 $>$ 短跑运动员 $>$", "子弹：质量的五个数量级，远非速率所能弥补。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:newtons-laws:2}", "$N = m(g + a_z)$：(a) $70 \\times 11.01 = \\qty{771}{N}$；", "(b) $a_z = 0$，故 $N = mg = \\qty{687}{N}$ --- 第一定律：", "速度恒定，受力相互抵消；(c) $70 \\times 8.61 = \\qty{603}{N}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:newtons-laws:3}", "$a = g\\sin 30^\\circ = \\qty{4.9}{m/s^2}$；", "$v = \\sqrt{2 \\times 4.905 \\times 3.0} = \\qty{5.4}{m/s}$。质量", "在 $ma$ 与 $mg\\sin\\alpha$ 之间约去。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:newtons-laws:4}", "速度反向：$\\Delta p = 0.058 \\times (25 + 15) = \\qty{2.3}{kg.m/s}$；", "$F = 2.32/0.0050 = \\qty{4.6e2}{N}$ --- 约为 $800$ 倍的", "\\qty{0.57}{N} 重力，这就是接触过程中可忽略重力的原因。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:newtons-laws:5}", "重力（地球作用于书，竖直向下）的反作用力为书对地球的拉力，竖直向上。", "法向力（桌面作用于书，竖直向上）的反作用力为书对桌面的压力，", "竖直向下。重力与法向力作用于\\emph{同一}物体，且属于两种不同的相互作用 ---", "在此二者大小相等，仅因 $\\vect a = \\vect 0$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:newtons-laws:6}", "$N = mg = \\qty{490}{N}$。(a) $F > \\mu_s N = \\qty{221}{N}$。", "(b) $a = (220.7 - 0.35 \\times 490.5)/50 = \\qty{0.98}{m/s^2}$。", "(c) $F = \\mu_k N = \\qty{172}{N}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:newtons-laws:7}", "(a) 当 $\\tan\\alpha > \\mu_s$ 时开始滑动：$\\alpha = \\arctan 0.45 \\approx", "24^\\circ$。(b) $a = g(\\sin 30^\\circ - 0.35\\cos 30^\\circ) =", "9.81 \\times 0.197 = \\qty{1.9}{m/s^2}$。(c) 是：一旦滑动，", "摩擦力降为 $\\mu_k < \\mu_s$，故", "$a = g\\cos\\alpha\\,(\\tan\\alpha - \\mu_k) \\approx \\qty{0.9}{m/s^2} > 0$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:newtons-laws:8}", "$a = m_2 g/(m_1 + m_2) = 19.62/5.0 = \\qty{3.9}{m/s^2}$；", "$T = m_1 a = \\qty{11.8}{N}$。悬挂的物块向下加速，", "故其所受合力向下：$T$ 必须小于 $m_2 g$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:newtons-laws:9}", "$v_{\\max} = \\sqrt{\\mu_s g R}$：干燥路面", "$\\sqrt{0.70 \\times 9.81 \\times 50} = \\qty{18.5}{m/s} \\approx", "\\qty{67}{km/h}$；潮湿路面 $\\qty{14.0}{m/s} = \\qty{50}{km/h}$。", "两者 $mv^2/R$ 与 $\\mu_s mg$ 均含 $m$，故约去。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:newtons-laws:10}", "竖直方向：$T\\cos\\theta = mg$，故", "$T = 2.943/\\cos 25^\\circ = \\qty{3.2}{N}$。半径 $R = L\\sin\\theta =", "\\qty{0.507}{m}$；径向：$T\\sin\\theta = mv^2/R$，故", "$v = \\sqrt{gR\\tan\\theta} = \\sqrt{9.81 \\times 0.507 \\times 0.466}", "= \\qty{1.5}{m/s}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:newtons-laws:11}", "$a_z = (N - mg)/m$，其中 $mg = \\qty{49.05}{N}$：$+\\qty{1.0}{m/s^2}$、", "$0$、$-\\qty{1.0}{m/s^2}$。例如向上运行的电梯：先加速，再匀速，", "最后减速。是的：若进入时已向下运动，相同读数则表示减速、匀速、", "再次向下加速 --- 体重秤读数反映的是加速度，而非", "速度。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:newtons-laws:12}", "(a) $0 = 60V + 4.0 \\times 8.0$：$V = \\qty{-0.53}{m/s}$。", "(b) 球相对地面的速度为 $8.0 + V$：$0 = 60V + 4.0(8.0 + V)$，故", "$V = -32/64 = \\qty{-0.50}{m/s}$，球以 \\qty{7.5}{m/s} 飞出。", "(c) 球对她双手的推力 --- 她投掷动作的", "第三定律反作用力。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:newtons-laws:13}", "无摩擦：$N\\cos\\theta = mg$（竖直方向）且 $N\\sin\\theta =", "mv^2/R$（径向）；两式相除，$\\tan\\theta = v^2/(gR) = 400/784.8$：", "$\\theta \\approx 27^\\circ$。速度较慢时，汽车有沿弯道斜面向下滑动的趋势，", "摩擦力须沿斜面向上；速度较快时则相反。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:newtons-laws:14}", "(a) $250 \\times 2500 = \\qty{6.3e5}{kg.m/s}$，即每秒推力", "为 $\\qty{6.3e5}{N}$。(b) $P = \\qty{4.9e5}{N}$；", "$a = (6.25 - 4.905) \\times 10^5 / \\num{5.0e4} = \\qty{2.7}{m/s^2}$.", "(c) 火箭推的是自身喷出的气体（第三定律），而非空气。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:newtons-laws:15}", "(a) $m_2 g > \\mu_s m_1 g$：$m_2 > 0.35 \\times 4.0 = \\qty{1.4}{kg}$。", "(b) $a = (m_2 - \\mu_k m_1)\\,g/(m_1 + m_2) = 1.0 \\times 9.81/6.0 =", "\\qty{1.6}{m/s^2}$；$T = m_2(g - a) = \\qty{16.4}{N}$。", "(c) 令 $\\mu_k = 0$，得 $a = m_2 g/(m_1 + m_2)$，", "即\\cref{exo:g12:newtons-laws:8}中的公式。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:g12:newtons-laws:1}", "\\textbf{1.} 研究对象：车厢 $+$ 车架（$+$ 乘客）。山体", "固定于地面，可视为惯性参考系，精度极高。受力：", "重力 $M\\vect g$（竖直向下）、轨道缆线的法向力 $\\vect N$", "（与轨道垂直）、牵引张力 $\\vect T$（沿斜坡向上）。", ""]}